[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0290","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-47300","title":"Microsoft ASP.NET Core Negotiate 认证特权提升漏洞","description":"ASP.NET Core Negotiate 认证组件中存在认证算法实现缺陷漏洞（CWE-303），由于 Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.Negotiate 包对身份验证算法的实现不正确，已获得授权的攻击者可通过网络向目标 ASP.NET Core 应用发送特制的认证请求，利用 Negotiate 认证与 LDAP 角色查询组合场景下的逻辑缺陷，将自身权限提升至管理员级别。该漏洞影响 .NET 8/9/10 及对应的 Visual Studio 产品，仅在使用 Negotiate 认证且通过 LDAP 检索角色信息时受影响。CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2026 年 7 月安全更新中发布修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-47300","GHSA-8prm-248r-h957"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14T19:17:08.303","updated":"2026-07-22T17:33:12.873","remediation":"将 Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.Negotiate 包升级至 .NET 8.0.29 / .NET 9.0.18 / .NET 10.0.10 及以上版本；通过 `dotnet --info` 确认当前版本，在项目文件中更新 PackageReference 版本号后重新生成部署。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 Negotiate 认证方式或避免使用 LDAP 检索角色信息作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-47300","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/8284a6b46d384416350a482bbbfb023f0fdf4177/release-notes/10.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47300.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-14/TIER_2_CVE-2026-47300.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2026/47xxx/CVE-2026-47300.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-47300","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-47300.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/75714204a4d47ab0def5b37be4839e1beb10bacd/content/posts/cve-2026-47300.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-47300.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-47300/poc.py","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/adeb612bf3a5b4f2b8426bc5720e617d432d1455/cve/CVE-2026-47300.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0275","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0275.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45263","title":"FacturaScripts CSVExport CSV公式注入漏洞","description":"FacturaScripts 的 CSVExport 功能存在 CSV 公式注入漏洞（CWE-1236），低权限认证用户可在客户名称等字段中插入以 =、+、-、@ 等开头的恶意公式载荷。Core/Lib/Export/CSVExport.php::writeData() 在生成 CSV 时未对单元格首字符进行公式触发前缀检查，直接将原始值写入文件。管理员通过 ListCliente 页面导出 CSV 后，在 Excel 或 LibreOffice 中打开时公式自动执行，可触发 DDE 命令执行或凭据窃取。攻击者可利用任意具备数据写入权限的低权限账号种植载荷，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45263","GHSA-2p5x-4jr6-x5jg"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14","updated":"2026-07-14","remediation":"在 Core/Lib/Export/CSVExport.php 的 writeData() 方法中对以 =、+、-、@、制表符、回车符开头的单元格值自动添加前导单引号改为纯文本格式，同时需在 writeHeader() 和 XLSExport::getCursorRawData() 中应用相同修复。升级至包含该补丁的版本。临时缓解措施：在 Excel 中禁用 DDE 自动执行，在 LibreOffice 中设置宏安全级别为高。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts/security/advisories/GHSA-2p5x-4jr6-x5jg","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-2p5x-4jr6-x5jg","https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0275.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0274","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0274.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45262","title":"FacturaScripts REST API 认证后SQL注入漏洞","description":"FacturaScripts 是一款开源 ERP/会计系统，其 REST API 的 filter 参数存在 SQL 注入漏洞。漏洞位于 `Where::sqlColumn` 方法中，攻击者可通过在 filter 参数中注入括号绕过过滤，构造恶意 UNION SELECT 语句。即使仅持有受限 API Key（仅 `clientes` 资源的 GET 权限）的认证攻击者，也可通过发送特制请求获取管理员密码的 bcrypt 哈希值等敏感数据，导致权限提升。该漏洞影响 FacturaScripts 主分支版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45262","GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj"],"sources":["cve","ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-14","updated":"2026-07-14","remediation":"立即升级至 FacturaScripts 2026.3 及以上版本（当前最新为 2026.5），该版本已对 REST API 的 filter 和 sort 参数进行模型字段白名单校验，阻止恶意 SQL 注入。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面配置 WAF 规则拦截包含 UNION/SELECT 等关键词的 API 请求参数，并限制 ApiKey 的 fullaccess 权限为最小必要范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts/security/advisories/GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj","https://github.com/NeoRazorX/facturascripts","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj/GHSA-5qmh-x653-g8qj.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0274.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0268","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44300","title":"OpenCost /serviceKey 端点未授权凭证覆盖注入漏洞","description":"OpenCost 存在未授权文件写入漏洞，位于 /serviceKey 端点。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该端点直接覆盖 GCP 服务账号密钥文件，无需任何认证即可实施攻击。该漏洞可导致 Kubernetes 集群内服务中断、凭据窃取及权限提升，影响 OpenCost 所有版本。建议用户立即升级修复版本或限制 /serviceKey 端点的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44300","GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5","GO-2026-5974"],"sources":["ghsa","cve"],"published":"2026-07-14","updated":"2026-07-22","remediation":"立即升级 OpenCost 至 v1.119.1 及以上版本，该版本通过 adminAuthMiddleware 要求所有管理端点（包括 /serviceKey）必须配置 ADMIN_TOKEN 环境变量方可访问。在 Helm 部署中设置 opencost.exporter.adminToken 值。若无法立即升级，通过 Kubernetes NetworkPolicy 限制对 OpenCost 服务 9003 端口的网络访问，仅允许受信任的客户端 IP；同时在容器启动参数中移除 CONFIG_PATH 可写目录挂载，或将配置目录设为只读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/opencost/opencost/security/advisories/GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wmj8-9953-vff5"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0268.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0268.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0268.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0278","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0278.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45376","title":"Decidim 管理后台用户搜索 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"Decidim 是一套公民参与平台框架。其管理后台用户搜索端点 GET /admin/organization/users 使用来自 params[:term] 的不可信输入构造 SQL ORDER BY 表达式，且字符串插值发生在 ActiveRecord 消毒处理之前。攻击者需持有管理员会话，通过构造特殊搜索字符串可向 PostgreSQL 注入任意 SQL，利用时序差异进行盲注，读取数据库角色权限范围内的其他表数据或造成拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45376","GHSA-jvqq-cvh4-xm37"],"sources":["cve","github"],"published":"2026-07-13","updated":"2026-07-13","remediation":"升级 decidim-admin 至 0.30.9、0.31.5 或 0.32.0 版本。如暂无法升级，应严格审查并限制具有后台访问权限的管理员账户，仅授权可信人员，以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T16:59:49Z","references":["https://github.com/decidim/decidim/security/advisories/GHSA-jvqq-cvh4-xm37","https://github.com/decidim/decidim/pull/16668"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0278.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0277","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0277.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45330","title":"Decidim 验证管理员跨组织越权访问身份信息漏洞","description":"Decidim 参与式民主平台的身份验证管理功能存在越权访问漏洞。验证管理员控制器在加载待审核授权记录时使用 Authorization.find() 进行原始查询，未检查该记录是否属于当前组织（current_organization），导致拥有验证管理员权限的攻击者可跨组织访问、批准或拒绝其他租户的身份文档验证请求，造成敏感身份信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45330","GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c"],"sources":["ghsa","cve"],"published":"2026-07-13","updated":"2026-07-13","remediation":"升级 Decidim 至 v0.32.0（或 v0.31.5、v0.30.9）及以上版本，该修复在 PR #16666 中合入，在验证管理员控制器中增加了 current_organization 归属检查。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用身份文档验证方式作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/decidim/decidim/security/advisories/GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c","https://github.com/decidim/decidim/pull/16666","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c/GHSA-86fh-w43w-338c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0277.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0277.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0273","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-45086","title":"Decidim 人口统计问卷管理编辑器授权缺失漏洞","description":"Decidim 平台的人口统计问卷管理编辑器存在授权缺失漏洞。/admin/demographics/questions 路由未对调用者进行管理员权限校验，已登录的普通参与者可直接访问管理界面并修改问卷内容。攻击者只需拥有普通用户账号即可利用此漏洞，无需管理员权限，可导致问卷数据被未授权篡改，影响平台数据完整性与管理安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-45086","GHSA-vq6j-hj8w-7v39"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-13","updated":"2026-07-13","remediation":"升级至 Decidim 0.32.0 或 0.31.5 及以上版本，这两个版本已在 PR #16665 中修复 /admin/demographics/questions 路由缺少管理员权限校验的问题。如无法立即升级，可禁用 decidim-demographics 模块，或在 Nginx 反向代理层限制该路径的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T16:14:59.837816679+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0273.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0273.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0187","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0187.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Oracle Unified Directory 未授权访问漏洞","description":"Oracle Unified Directory 存在权限许可和访问控制漏洞，未经认证的远程攻击者可通过 LDAP 或 RMI 接口向目标系统发送特制请求，绕过身份验证机制实现对目录服务的未授权访问。成功利用该漏洞可导致敏感目录信息泄露、权限提升甚至横向移动，威胁系统安全。该漏洞影响 Oracle Unified Directory 多个受支持版本，建议用户及时关注 Oracle 官方安全公告并安装相应补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2026-0337db81"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-13","updated":"2026-07-13","remediation":"立即通过 My Oracle Support 下载并安装适用于当前 Oracle Unified Directory 版本的最新 Critical Patch Update（CPU）补丁并完成重启验证；在补丁落地前，于网络边界与主机防火墙严格限制 LDAP（389/636）及 RMI 管理端口仅对可信管理网段开放，关闭或限制匿名绑定与未鉴权 RMI 访问，并定期审计目录访问与认证日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2026.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0009","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0009.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Universal 1337 Stealer 窃密恶意软件文件检测规则","description":"Universal 1337 Stealer 是一款针对 FTP 凭据和系统敏感信息进行窃取的 Stealer 类恶意软件。该恶意软件通过二进制特征标记（如 [SPLIT]、[HERE]、FTP~ 等特定字符串模式）在文件中留下痕迹。Nuclei 模板通过匹配文件中的二进制特征码（包括 2A5B532D502D4C2D492D545D2A、4654507E 等十六进制模式）来检测该恶意软件。感染后攻击者可窃取 FTP 客户端账号密码、系统配置等敏感数据，影响系统机密性与数据安全。传播途径主要包括钓鱼邮件附件和恶意捆绑下载。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["NUCLEI-FILE-MALWARE-UNIVERSAL-1337-MALWARE-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2026-07-13","updated":"2026-07-13","remediation":"建议使用杀毒软件（如 ClamAV、Microsoft Defender、卡巴斯基等）对系统进行全盘扫描以检测并清除 Universal 1337 Stealer 恶意软件。及时更新病毒库至最新版本。修改可能已被窃取的所有 FTP 账号密码及其他敏感凭证。排查系统异常进程和启动项，删除检出恶意文件后重启系统，勿打开来源不明的邮件附件或点击可疑链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T12:10:58.703169817+00:00","references":["https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/file/malware/universal-1337-malware.yaml","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/master/malware/MALW_Stealer.yar"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0113","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59260","title":"OpenWrt luci-app-samba4 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenWrt luci-app-samba4 存在 ACL 权限配置不当漏洞，其 read ACL 不当授予了 /usr/sbin/smbd 的 file.exec 权限，导致经过身份验证的委派用户能够以调用者控制的命令行参数执行 Samba 守护进程。攻击者可向 root 权限的 smbd 进程传递 message command 等任意 Samba 全局选项，当 SMB 协议消息被处理时触发命令执行。该漏洞影响运行 OpenWrt 并启用 luci-app-samba4 组件的设备，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59260"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-12T12:16:45.977","updated":"2026-07-13T20:03:31.703","remediation":"立即升级 OpenWrt 至修复该漏洞的版本（关注官方安全公告中 luci-app-samba4 的补丁更新）。临时缓解措施：移除 /usr/sbin/smbd 文件上多余的 file.exec ACL 权限（执行 `setfacl -x u:anyuser:exec /usr/sbin/smbd`）；在 luci-app-samba4 配置中禁用未使用的 Samba 全局选项传递功能；在防火墙层面限制 SMB 端口（139,445）仅允许受信任的内网 IP 访问；审查并收紧 luci-app-samba4 的 ACL 配置，确保 smbd 可执行文件仅对 root 具有执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/openwrt/luci/security/advisories/GHSA-vx64-mmp7-h36c","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/openwrt-luci-app-samba4-read-acl-remote-code-execution-via-smbd","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59260.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-12/TIER_2_CVE-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59260.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-59260/README.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%EF%BD%9COpenWrt%20Samba%E8%A2%AB%E6%9B%9D%E9%AB%98%E5%8D%B1%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2026-59260)%EF%BC%8C%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E8%80%85%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96Root%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59260.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7pqv-wj3v-fcq3/GHSA-7pqv-wj3v-fcq3.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59260.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-59260"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0110","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56259","title":"Crawl4AI Docker API 凭据泄露漏洞","description":"Crawl4AI Docker API 服务器存在凭据泄露漏洞（CWE-200），影响 0.8.8 之前版本。攻击者无需认证即可访问 /md、/llm、/llm/job 等接口，通过构造恶意的 base_url 参数将 LLM API 调用重定向至攻击者控制的端点，并设置 api_token 为 env:VARIABLE_NAME 格式读取任意环境变量，从而窃取 JWT 签名密钥、Provider API Key、Redis 密码等敏感凭据。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，可能导致服务器被完全接管。官方已在 0.8.8 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56259"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-12T12:16:45.013","updated":"2026-07-14T18:29:21.830","remediation":"立即升级 Crawl4AI 至 0.8.8 或更高版本（修补提交 aa81e8f），该版本已修复 base_url 参数重定向问题并增强 LLMConfig 环境变量解析保护。如无法升级，设置 CRAWL4AI_API_TOKEN 环境变量启用 JWT 认证，并在防火墙/反向代理层限制 Docker API 端口（默认 8080/11234）仅允许受信任来源访问；升级后立即轮换所有已泄露的 Provider API Key、JWT_SECRET_KEY 及 REDIS_PASSWORD 等敏感凭据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/unclecode/crawl4ai/security/advisories/GHSA-f989-c77f-r2cq","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/crawl4ai-llm-credential-exfiltration-via-base-url-and-environment-variable-resolution","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/367702ad7530a5ba67c1bf5ac2a64f2d7987df9f/data/vuln/crawl4ai/CVE-2026-56259.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56259.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/fdf19595af0ac0832011c9bde3da2f545d136f2f/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-56259.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-12/TIER_2_CVE-2026-56259.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/56xxx/CVE-2026-56259.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2026/CVE-2026-56259/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-56259.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-56259.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Crawl4AI_Docker_API_%E5%AF%86%E9%92%A5%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-56259.toml","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/30850bb53811ed82eaed94570f6e3c90461f27d7/vulns/crawl4ai/PYSEC-2026-3448.yaml","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56259"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0110.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0110.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0109","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-56238","title":"Capgo PostgREST 全局统计端点信息泄露漏洞","description":"Capgo 的 Supabase PostgREST 全局统计端点存在信息泄露漏洞，未认证的远程攻击者可利用公开的 apikey 直接访问 /rest/v1/global_stats 接口，无需任何额外身份验证即可获取 MRR、总收入、套餐收入细分、客户数量及运营遥测等敏感财务与业务指标数据。该漏洞影响 Capgo 12.128.2 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高危。厂商已发布 12.128.2 版本修复此漏洞，建议在升级前通过反向代理或 WAF 限制对该端点的外部访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-56238"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-12","updated":"2026-07-13","remediation":"立即升级到 Capgo 12.128.2 或更高版本；在升级前，通过反向代理/WAF 限制对 /rest/v1/global_stats 端点的外部访问，仅允许受信 IP 或内网访问；禁用不必要公开的 PostgREST 端点并轮换当前泄露的 public apikey。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/Cap-go/capgo/security/advisories/GHSA-73rv-fpp7-r3r4","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/capgo-unauthenticated-information-disclosure-via-postgrest-global-stats-endpoint","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-56238"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0005","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0005.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"CNNVD 未分类漏洞 2026-10197788","description":"CNNVD-2026-10197788 是 CNNVD 在 2026 年收录的一则安全漏洞。目前该漏洞的详细技术细节尚未公开披露，CNNVD 官方尚未发布完整的漏洞描述信息。建议用户持续关注 CNNVD 官方网站获取最新公告，以便及时采取相应的安全防护措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10197788"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-12","updated":"2026-07-12","remediation":"密切关注 CNNVD 官方网站关于此漏洞的后续公告。一旦厂商发布安全更新或补丁，请立即评估影响范围并部署修复。同时建议加强网络边界防护和访问控制策略。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T22:43:48.006027371+00:00","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0091","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-49844","title":"Apache Log4j API MapMessage JSON 序列化编码漏洞","description":"Apache Log4j API 的 MapMessage JSON 序列化功能在处理非有限 IEEE 754 浮点值（NaN、Infinity、-Infinity）时存在编码缺陷，导致生成的 JSON 不符合 RFC 8259 标准。当应用程序使用 JsonTemplateLayout 的消息解析器或依赖 MapMessage.asJson() 的布局，并记录了包含攻击者可控浮点值的 MapMessage 时，非有限值会被直接输出为裸令牌，造成 JSON 格式错误。该漏洞可能破坏下游日志记录及解析流程，影响 Apache Log4j API 2.13.1 至 2.25.4 版本及 2.26.0 版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。用户应升级至 2.25.5 或 2.26.1 版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-49844"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-10T22:16:42.540","updated":"2026-07-14T20:03:09.910","remediation":"升级 Apache Log4j API 至 2.25.5 或 2.26.1 及以上版本，这两个版本已对非有限浮点值输出符合 RFC 8259 标准的 JSON。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对日志中浮点输入进行校验过滤，避免将 NaN/Infinity 等非有限值传入 MapMessage。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/apache/logging-log4j2/pull/4163","https://logging.apache.org/cyclonedx/vdr.xml","https://logging.apache.org/log4j/2.x/manual/json-template-layout.html#event-template-resolver-message","https://logging.apache.org/security.html#CVE-2026-49844","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c8f1603cb76d37d7aca26a74458e0aff33b0985a/cves/2026/49xxx/CVE-2026-49844.json","https://github.com/link-it/govway/blob/f01bfb4f0cf07a4cfba608c19cf0af9c99c352f1/resources/doc/src/manuali/vulnerability-management/securityAdvisory/2026/CVE-2026-49844.rst","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8c8fc2aa7ae119f7163aab3170ab59022c4e4e32/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-49844.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/f351737338813300e479bb1093f35fa5b7893f66/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-49844","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/23e59fd10f7619445bb3ab1ba838f2e531989c40/content/posts/cve-2026-49844.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-49844.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/f9dbeac859d4867f751f33dcefc11254b4d40ccb/data/2026/CVE-2026-49844.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Apache_Log4j_MapMessage_JSON_%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5_CVE-2026-49844.toml","https://github.com/apache/security-site/blob/688b49dd77e12d8bea3c3d690f69122f8f07c16a/static/projects/logging/CVE-2026-49844.cve.json","https://github.com/ministryofjustice/hmpps-gradle-spring-boot/blob/6498ddae6cd03f7139cd875bfd8e5c53f7d2934b/release-notes/11.x.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-49844"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0091.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0269","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44342","title":"New API 账号绑定跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"New API（LLM 网关与 AI 资产管理系统）0.12.0-alpha.1 之前版本中，邮箱绑定接口 GET /api/oauth/email/bind 和微信绑定接口 GET /api/oauth/wechat/bind 使用 GET 请求执行账户绑定等状态变更操作，违反 HTTP 方法语义。在会话 Cookie 允许跨站发送的部署环境下，远程攻击者可诱导已登录用户浏览器发起跨站请求，将攻击者控制的邮箱地址或 OAuth 身份绑定至用户账户，导致账户绑定状态被篡改。该漏洞属于跨站请求伪造（CWE-352），CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。开发者已在 0.12.0-alpha.1 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44342","GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-09T23:17:05.217","updated":"2026-07-16T16:37:07.970","remediation":"立即升级到 v0.12.0-alpha.1 及以上版本，该版本已将邮箱和微信绑定接口改为 POST 请求并添加 CSRF Token 校验。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 /api/oauth/email/bind 和 /api/oauth/wechat/bind 路径拦截 GET 请求，仅允许 POST 方法作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/commit/e099117c61391abdf888fb75e382a582e550bd0e","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/releases/tag/v0.12.0-alpha.1","https://github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/security/advisories/GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/184a4cd474c4aaa5a27dac20b468f57966faa421/data/vuln/new-api/CVE-2026-44342.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44342.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4d1eebacb731643a646e28a4f60e64dd753a5ff4/proposals/euvd/CVE-2026-44342.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-44342.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/github.com/QuantumNous/new-api/CVE-2026-44342.yml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-44342.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-44342.json","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/05da64c166d4f0c1282a01018eb34f5a34c00175/data/osv/GO-2026-5929.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/ade01d2e0e3b718f00ee8257bccf82b519181ac8/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-443xx/CVE-2026-44342.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m/GHSA-26v7-h57m-gh9m.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0269.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0269.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0269.toml"}]